*> Implementation test of the recipe book packet bodies of proto/src/recipe-book.cob (05c 0x27 Place
*> Recipe, 0x2F Change Settings, 0x30 Seen Recipe; 05b 0x4B Add, 0x4C Remove, 0x4D Settings; 27 4).
*> The packet id is the caller's. A writer appends nothing and sets PB-ERROR for a value it cannot
*> encode; a reader that fails sets PB-ERROR, leaves PB-POS where it was and yields zeros.
*> Recipe Book Add entries (RecipeDisplayEntry with its flags byte) use PB-RECIPE-ENTRY and a
*> PB-SLOT-DISPLAY-TABLE: slots are nodes numbered in the order they are read (a parent before its
*> children).
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-RECIPE-BOOK.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 COPY PROTO REPLACING LEADING ==PB-== BY ==PK-==.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 64.
 01 WS-HEX                 PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-HEX-B               PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-EDIT                PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-EXP-EDIT            PIC -9.99.
 01 WS-PTR                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-J                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-N                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LEN                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CONTAINER           BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-RECIPE              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-USE-MAX             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BOOK                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-OPEN                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FILTERING           BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-COUNT               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MAX                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-IDS.
    05 WS-ID               BINARY-LONG OCCURS 8 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
     CALL "PB-INIT" USING PK-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
     PERFORM SIMPLE-PACKET-CASES
     PERFORM LIST-CASES
     PERFORM ENTRY-PUT-CASES
     PERFORM ENTRY-GET-CASES
     PERFORM ENTRY-ERROR-CASES
     PERFORM HOLDERSET-CASES
     CALL "PB-FREE" USING PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-FREE" USING PK-BUFFER
     STOP RUN.

 SIMPLE-PACKET-CASES.
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     MOVE 2 TO WS-CONTAINER
     MOVE 300 TO WS-RECIPE
     MOVE 1 TO WS-USE-MAX
     CALL "PB-PUT-PLACE-RECIPE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CONTAINER WS-RECIPE WS-USE-MAX
     MOVE "test recipe-book PLACE-RECIPE put of container 2 recipe 300 use max" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "02ac0201" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-BYTES
     MOVE 0 TO WS-CONTAINER WS-RECIPE WS-USE-MAX
     CALL "PB-PUT-PLACE-RECIPE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CONTAINER WS-RECIPE WS-USE-MAX
     MOVE "test recipe-book PLACE-RECIPE put of container 0 recipe 0 not max" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "000000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-BYTES
     MOVE -1 TO WS-CONTAINER
     CALL "PB-PUT-PLACE-RECIPE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CONTAINER WS-RECIPE WS-USE-MAX
     MOVE "test recipe-book PLACE-RECIPE put of container -1 sets PB-ERROR, appends nothing"
         TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM CHECK-PUT-ERROR
     MOVE 0 TO WS-CONTAINER
     MOVE -1 TO WS-RECIPE
     CALL "PB-PUT-PLACE-RECIPE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CONTAINER WS-RECIPE WS-USE-MAX
     MOVE "test recipe-book PLACE-RECIPE put of recipe -1 sets PB-ERROR, appends nothing"
         TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM CHECK-PUT-ERROR
     MOVE "02 ac02 01" TO WS-HEX
     PERFORM FILL
     CALL "PB-GET-PLACE-RECIPE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CONTAINER WS-RECIPE WS-USE-MAX
     MOVE "test recipe-book PLACE-RECIPE get of container 2 recipe 300 use max" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "2 300 1 pos 4 error 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM START-FIELDS
     MOVE WS-CONTAINER TO WS-EDIT
     PERFORM ADD-FIELD
     MOVE WS-RECIPE TO WS-EDIT
     PERFORM ADD-FIELD
     MOVE WS-USE-MAX TO WS-EDIT
     PERFORM ADD-FIELD
     PERFORM END-FIELDS
     MOVE "02 ffffffff0f 01" TO WS-HEX
     PERFORM FILL
     CALL "PB-GET-PLACE-RECIPE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CONTAINER WS-RECIPE WS-USE-MAX
     MOVE "test recipe-book PLACE-RECIPE get of recipe -1 sets PB-ERROR, PB-POS 0, zeros"
         TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "0 0 0 pos 0 error 1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM START-FIELDS
     MOVE WS-CONTAINER TO WS-EDIT
     PERFORM ADD-FIELD
     MOVE WS-RECIPE TO WS-EDIT
     PERFORM ADD-FIELD
     MOVE WS-USE-MAX TO WS-EDIT
     PERFORM ADD-FIELD
     PERFORM END-FIELDS
     MOVE "02 ac02" TO WS-HEX
     PERFORM FILL
     CALL "PB-GET-PLACE-RECIPE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CONTAINER WS-RECIPE WS-USE-MAX
     MOVE "test recipe-book PLACE-RECIPE get without its flag sets PB-ERROR, PB-POS 0, zeros"
         TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "0 0 0 pos 0 error 1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM START-FIELDS
     MOVE WS-CONTAINER TO WS-EDIT
     PERFORM ADD-FIELD
     MOVE WS-RECIPE TO WS-EDIT
     PERFORM ADD-FIELD
     MOVE WS-USE-MAX TO WS-EDIT
     PERFORM ADD-FIELD
     PERFORM END-FIELDS
*>   ---- Seen Recipe ----
