     MOVE "300 pos 2 error 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM START-FIELDS
     MOVE WS-RECIPE TO WS-EDIT
     PERFORM ADD-FIELD
     PERFORM END-FIELDS
     MOVE "ffffffff0f" TO WS-HEX
     PERFORM FILL
     CALL "PB-GET-RECIPE-SEEN" USING PB-BUFFER WS-RECIPE
     MOVE "test recipe-book SEEN get of recipe -1 sets PB-ERROR, PB-POS 0, zero" TO TL-CASE
